    "result_text": "Done. The build passes with all tests green.\n\nI implemented the `initials` field with two changes:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added an `initials` property to the `Owner` schema (read-only string), so the generated `OwnerDto` gains an `initials` field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` that computes it:\n   ```java\n   owner.getFirstName().substring(0, 1).toUpperCase() + \".\" + owner.getLastName().substring(0, 1).toUpperCase() + \".\"\n   ```\n\nThis returns the upper-cased first letters of `firstName` and `lastName`, dot-separated with a trailing dot \u2014 e.g. `\"john\"` / `\"smith\"` \u2192 `\"J.S.\"`. The `AcceptanceTest.coreComputesInitials` test and the full suite pass (`BUILD SUCCESS`).",
